    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## The High-Score Hub: Designing for Alex\r\n\r\n**The User:** Alex wants an online marketplace app for trading vintage video games. She wants the site to feel retro, like it's from the 1980s.\r\n\r\n**Your Task:** Write a detailed prompt for AI Tutor to help you generate your web app layout. Your prompt must address the following three questions:\r\n\r\n1. What is the goal?\r\n> What information (e.g., game title, condition, trade value) does the marketplace track for each video game listing?\r\n\r\n2. What are the constraints?\r\n> What specific fonts, colors, and layout style should the page use to look like a retro arcade game?\r\n\r\n3. What are the edge cases?\r\n> How should the website handle a \"Sold Out\" item or a blurry user-uploaded photo?",
